{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "d1cc8051040d497c7c1e9c9b1e5dbfdc07eee7c98e55a5f3a892979b38353b01", "ja": "いざ、路上強襲舞台！", "zh": "前往街头突袭舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "639d5ff2e1aedc88a14b5b477a5ecfbf8c90d74b035764a0601df521f75ecbed", "ja": "路上ライブ当日。セッティングからすべて\n自分達でこなすメンバー。バンドマンに\n絡まれるハプニングがあったものの、歌に\n対する強い気持ちで打ち勝つ。その後、\n全員で無事ライブを成功させるのだった。", "zh": "到了街头演唱会当天，\n全员一手包办连同器材设置在内的所有工作。\n途中虽然发生被其他乐团找碴的意外，\n她们仍用对歌唱的强烈信念来克服。\n之后，全员一起成功举办演唱会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "111b915981a741151628b169e1e1b526e619be86f57fea698c6fcbc3507f85d8", "ja": "（よく晴れた、いい天気だ。\n路上ライブをするにはうってつけの日だな！）", "zh": "（今天很晴朗，天气真好。\n是很适合办街头演唱会的日子呢！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "77b9f25a136aea4dcd2138a37497dda347a6e9f1659d8f47d2aca2b0ea172bbf", "ja": "{$P$}、\nこっちの機材、セッティング終わったぜ。", "zh": "{$P$}，\n这边的器材设置好啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1002_p", "source_sha256": "909a4798f3f59e271703afcf9c1ab179517d9f91727c5cda841760b492263bfd", "ja": "ああ、ありがとうジュリア。お疲れさま！\nあとはリハーサルまで、休憩しててくれ。", "zh": "谢啦，茱莉亚，辛苦了！\n到排练时间之前，你就先休息吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "44df4e558a777a6e23899e711a29ce9faf4cfce2f6448431635303469b44c093", "ja": "わかったよ。今回は……いや、今回もか。\nウチらの無茶も聞いてくれて、ありがとな。", "zh": "我知道了。谢谢你这次愿意……\n不，是这次也愿意听我们强人所难的要求。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1004_p", "source_sha256": "5d5e2b24ea0a5e8c1797854b1fb90fb3429708d5745cf5e8f13f876525d698e0", "ja": "お礼を言うのは俺の方だよ。ジュリアのおかげで、\nエターナルハーモニーはいいユニットになったと思う。", "zh": "要道谢的是我啦。我觉得多亏有茱莉亚，\n才让『Eternal Harmony』得以变成一个好团体。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "f23925f8a6c95fd2dca62315e2253a4487931639a27c511f3d76ff6cae02db6e", "ja": "な……なんだよその言い方、別にあたしは何も……。\nあ～、汗かいてきた……今日、ちょっと暑いな！", "zh": "你……你怎么这么说啦，我什么都没……\n啊～我开始冒汗了……今天有点热呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1006_p", "source_sha256": "80458c5b95782e45ed99e3fde8ff35f226bd1c4f257ffe8e98dda6efe4b32b01", "ja": "そうだな、ライブの前に飲み物を買っておくか。\nみんな、ちょっと待っててくれるか？", "zh": "就是说啊，我趁演唱会前先去买个饮料来好了。\n大家可以等我一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1007_041fuk", "source_sha256": "54ae8a889222074e742dd6c38ccabb1434d3fd8018986310da5ea29b5215dc5d", "ja": "あ、私、荷物持ち手伝います！\nエミリーちゃん、マイクの配置、お願いね。", "zh": "啊，我去帮忙拿东西！\n艾蜜莉，麦克风就拜托你来设置啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1008_032emi", "source_sha256": "01c546e505cdc240872c141a6ed7939613666d5406aa3575c1f2486921e56335", "ja": "はい、おまかせください！", "zh": "好的，请交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1009_032emi", "source_sha256": "e7d47e81eff86ec089706119179468f1a28c7070c77947f9406555e095bde19c", "ja": "あーあーあー……試験、試験です……。", "zh": "啊～啊～啊～测试、测试……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1010_032emi", "source_sha256": "440e7e7a76afeaefbd87b047968cdf0e3f641ee54daab471596edf014ccd3972", "ja": "拡声器、バッチリです♪", "zh": "扩音器准备好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1011_002chi", "source_sha256": "2a2b6817fd2194b68c04b9e4283561bf9610cb468d57969b488ffa0e818b6342", "ja": "ありがとう、エミリー。あとは\n{$P$}が戻ってきてから……あっ。", "zh": "谢谢你，艾蜜莉。\n再来就等{$P$}回来……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1012_rojobandman", "source_sha256": "db144a8784af9d8636d748e215d0a771bccc0ef68175d7f9d7ec5e7f85ff0794", "ja": "おまえら、ここで何してんだ？", "zh": "你们在这里做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1013_032emi", "source_sha256": "63b0a53cd81edf40031293fd128ba9d36729c27e83d913a1c83bcbf1dcfcab8a", "ja": "えっ……。", "zh": "咦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1014_rojobandman", "source_sha256": "3efcded9280962540a7f9f6132da5d5df864fbe20caae8caf81dd5b03eba60ae", "ja": "ここはオレたちが、普段演奏してる場所なんだ。\n好き勝手すんじゃねーぞ。", "zh": "这里是我们平常在演奏的地方，\n你们少给我随便占用。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1015_032emi", "source_sha256": "0ee11580208986aa4f1274acba0a01bd71ccaa2431a213607c1dc52d37042599", "ja": "あ、あの。\nでも、私たちは……。", "zh": "那、那个，\n可是我们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1016_rojobandman", "source_sha256": "91325828550460c7877436f758a894aa918e2e8e1252563bf82a40ebc06629c5", "ja": "ああ！？", "zh": "什么！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1017_032emi", "source_sha256": "aa430f3969453ff929867980b2de00d2945a57c6c4fed7697a5d33d1d8c00850", "ja": "きゃっ！？", "zh": "呀！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1018_021mat", "source_sha256": "6299dd94b13adec3a860299ef23e2305b6b0086a2ce6f20235af822cc7dd0739", "ja": "……ほ？　何を言っているのです？\nまつりたち、許可はちゃーんと取ってあるのです。", "zh": "……哦？你在说什么的呀？\n茉莉我们可是有正式取得许可的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1019_rojobandman", "source_sha256": "de5f0e2a96d6604911fa082a5ae60f12fb38d9847e82316d45c84f783a1ac888", "ja": "ああ？　おまえら、どっかで見た気が……。\nああ、そうかテレビだ。おまえら、アイドルだろ？", "zh": "啊？我好像在哪里看过你们……\n哦，对了是在电视上。你们是偶像对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1020_rojobandman", "source_sha256": "cae61b268620a7353d927011dea071baead9573b231f2d1c84926a852eb91a7a", "ja": "アイドルが路上ライブだって？　どうせヘタくそな\n歌をダンスで誤魔化すつもりなんだろ？　笑わせるな！", "zh": "偶像要办街头演唱会？反正你们肯定是想用跳舞\n来掩盖自己的烂唱功吧？别搞笑了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1021_050jul", "source_sha256": "79b7d50beb69979e648b61a0463807ea996368cda8c00b0015c0337030ae1cdb", "ja": "アイドルをバカにするな！！", "zh": "少瞧不起偶像！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1022_050jul", "source_sha256": "4eb7952eff307a33e6b493a2fbf05b6d87121c1cf8f2f22f56aebf6ab0edf8fa", "ja": "ウチらは本気だ。\n歌もダンスも、毎日、全力で取り組んでる……。", "zh": "我们是认真的。\n我们每天都尽全力在练习唱歌和跳舞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1023_032emi", "source_sha256": "0b75335daf20b73ff6c8b2252f4296349a09b87739e6153dfe6832b67ce3a68a", "ja": "ジュリアさん……。", "zh": "茱莉亚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1024_050jul", "source_sha256": "1bf1f50df4f991df6241d939a260ed38774de5a5e6ac4ab75712aa1225d6ab49", "ja": "遊びで音楽をやってる連中に、\nグダグダ言われる筋合いなんかないんだよ！", "zh": "像你们这种觉得音乐只是玩玩而已的家伙，\n没资格对我们说三道四！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1025_rojobandman", "source_sha256": "af4741cadc0e7ebea1ccee0b3d6834ac4fee301a3545a691854388206df6f276", "ja": "はあ？　んだと……。生意気ぬかしやがって！\nてめえらが、オレ達の何を知ってるっていうんだよ！", "zh": "啊？你说什么……口气不小嘛！\n你们懂我们什么了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1026_002chi", "source_sha256": "bc3e92161a7e5ace20190a8bcc306adb779de0004f5c7bd9c4133391407ae9da", "ja": "貴方たちこそ、私たちの何をご存じなんですか？", "zh": "你们才是，又知道我们什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1027_rojobandman", "source_sha256": "20c7a1f58ea85338a22d8469745edd3a7c545c44eea3ddfd3fb2061276676eba", "ja": "るっせーん……って！？", "zh": "吵死了……呃！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1028_032emi", "source_sha256": "d7bb95549bd3616a40454ba1b24a89e43b05a48920cd82ecab9de0602662980e", "ja": "千早さん……！", "zh": "千早……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1029_rojobandman", "source_sha256": "8f9cae200a4fd95fb6892ec38e7e8afe10246c4ee2633ec92111cf56bbc545d1", "ja": "き……如月、千早……ちゃ……", "zh": "如……如月、千早……妹……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1030_002chi", "source_sha256": "292459033cec674737d80a7bcf4c3df1236f3c73aeb50415de24652b442d5f29", "ja": "私は貴方たちの歌を、先ほど聴かせてもらいました。\n高音で声が掠れたのは、喉をケアしていない証拠です。", "zh": "我刚才有听见你们唱的歌。\n你们唱高音时会沙哑，就是没有在保养喉咙的证据。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1031_rojobandman", "source_sha256": "0a1deb829328a3d157668b343bc039e4149f2fd4c8acb037ffc949f02e022dfe", "ja": "うっ……、うるせー！\nロックはな、勢いが大事なんで……大事なんだよ！", "zh": "吵……吵死了！\n对摇滚来说，重要的是气势……这才是重点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1032_002chi", "source_sha256": "0b6917b56a31c0bdd94985b2332004be79a7cc462c8354be492bb35ec27ed70d", "ja": "勢いという割には、歌への熱意が欠けているように\n感じました。本当にロックを愛しているんですか？", "zh": "比起气势，我反而感觉你们对歌唱欠缺热忱。\n你们真的爱摇滚吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1033_002chi", "source_sha256": "3c8f4d41615896bd1c161a66dc35f5ab2e35f6565b1d087c10207af84eb49611", "ja": "私たちは今日まで、毎日レッスンを重ねてきました。\nそして何より、歌に魂をこめています。", "zh": "我们至今为止，每天都在不断训练。\n最重要的是，我们在歌曲里倾注了灵魂。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1034_002chi", "source_sha256": "0eca8aeecf835771b7b3936ec96c745470c9f25615aa8cef84003d7ecaaa110d", "ja": "断言します。\n私たち、エターナルハーモニーが歌にこめた魂は……", "zh": "我敢这样断言。\n我们『Eternal Harmony』在歌曲中所倾注的灵魂……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1035_002chi", "source_sha256": "1ab938052600d2731df977426353abcae8f695273886a5ce9afc3bd27e0d56e2", "ja": "貴方たちには、絶対に負けていません！", "zh": "绝对不会输给你们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1036_rojobandman", "source_sha256": "5f69bca565a3e60d904150ca651e84545aad9be455b41120c5fbf7b061fef891", "ja": "く……！\nいや、俺たちだってなぁ～！", "zh": "唔……！\n不，我们也是啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1037_p", "source_sha256": "f60f9e880a4158b2a2c9a182a285499a7612fe74fc2ec1d435e3b149862f6d34", "ja": "おい、何をしている！？", "zh": "喂，你们在做什么！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1038_032emi", "source_sha256": "e90e8ea496a8037a5cd227b5032cda6bbfde3f3cfdaed6471cf43883142004dc", "ja": "し、仕掛け人さま……！", "zh": "策、策划执行人先生……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1039_p", "source_sha256": "ce81c140b1c7310d04561eb76c484c5ffe4ecf903dd658d16ff03cc8ea902893", "ja": "ここでライブをする許可は取ってある。\n文句があるなら、警察を呼ぶぞ！", "zh": "我们有取得在这里办演唱会的许可。\n如果有意见，我就叫警察来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1040_rojobandman", "source_sha256": "a771adf8913e41e9c743180c6af9e7e91d2a6db7302f02c55cc54b5ffe9705dd", "ja": "チッ……オイ、行くぞ！", "zh": "啧……喂，走人啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1041_041fuk", "source_sha256": "94c072146eeb8dd9b74215861ca4eab92c1afe7d74b665a4c01c1e6cbb8109c8", "ja": "みんな、大丈夫！？\nケガは？　何もされなかった？", "zh": "各位，你们没事吗！？\n有受伤吗？没有被动粗吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1042_032emi", "source_sha256": "8d375e0f9cf0c9f99898b279204b166d5b71a3fa53ba2d81f86b1d17ab12f986", "ja": "は、はい、平気です。\nですが……ですが……。", "zh": "是、是的，我们没事。\n但是……但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1043_p", "source_sha256": "3790a87e938288f29df6d0edf03c682fffd9ed944b818f4cf49005fd84ce7092", "ja": "エミリー？", "zh": "艾蜜莉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1044_032emi", "source_sha256": "11e52242a01a1456b43805ff8c4192ab484e63b7be1746c3b34324c9c3ec4dad", "ja": "私……私だけ、あの方たちに……\n何も、言い返せませんでした……。", "zh": "我……只有我面对那群人时……\n一句话都没能回嘴……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1045_032emi", "source_sha256": "558544cc5c6660fac1b5fa51181346900a1c116a91bb45a7db739f1f32c1bdd6", "ja": "みなさんが一生懸命、歌も舞も練習していたこと、\nずっとそばで見て、知っていたのに……私……。", "zh": "我明明一直从旁看着各位拚命练习唱歌跳舞，\n我明明都知道……我却……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1046_032emi", "source_sha256": "279209ad872d0f9caba45881cee29111c608095c1d046db89d523347ca2afdfa", "ja": "ごめんなさい、みなさん……\n仕掛け人さま、ごめんなさい……。", "zh": "对不起，各位……\n策划执行人先生，对不起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1047_021mat", "source_sha256": "4fe8fb6df3e6ebbf53642bae36471a2380b7e8970c792b8c78b345065267847b", "ja": "そんなこと、気にしなくていいのですよ。\nエミリーちゃんは、がんばったのです！", "zh": "用不着在意这种事的喔。\n小艾蜜莉很努力了唷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1048_050jul", "source_sha256": "a514d0f214394d83f37a715f77d42db5859010c1f8c7149e2bbe099682946df0", "ja": "ああ。あんなのは、言い返せるヤツが言えばいい。\n第一、ウチらの仕事はケンカじゃないしな。", "zh": "是啊，那些话就交给敢回嘴的人来讲就好了，\n而且我们的工作又不是吵架。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1049_002chi", "source_sha256": "874000dbff09e92a9626a37b10f0b7b355b3fbf8097494e5d19c2d8f6fbf5b62", "ja": "ええ、そうね。\n私達は、歌うためにここへ来たの。", "zh": "是啊，一点都没错。\n我们是为了唱歌才来这里的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1050_002chi", "source_sha256": "a6fa9df0e89c2ad14c9882f77981ee6ee7431d4368ac68111d7e8ca8305494e4", "ja": "さあみんな、ライブを始めましょう！\n私たちの努力も、思いも……この歌で伝わるはず。", "zh": "来吧大家，开始演唱会吧！\n我们的努力和热情……一定能透过这首歌传达出去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1051_002chi", "source_sha256": "e26549cd6994e9c97e10cbbd9ca6274b75cd510fb614d7ae3724d44c8436813c", "ja": "だから……ね、エミリー。\n大丈夫。", "zh": "所以……艾蜜莉，\n没问题的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1052_032emi", "source_sha256": "b9db48f8e6d6f726bbd87da3750af6aecdb239eecd00f4bbf5deac8e2af15150", "ja": "千早さん……。\nはい……！", "zh": "千早……\n是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1053_002chi", "source_sha256": "da0e28cc84f3fe1f509602936f533048a28181056894fb2fab84782baefb8613", "ja": "みなさん、初めまして。私達は765プロ劇場の\n新しいユニット、エターナルハーモニーです。", "zh": "大家好，我们是765艺能剧场的新团体，\n叫做『Eternal Harmony』。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1054_002chi", "source_sha256": "00c2453831ab7d99871c98fca362e3f23936105ed156552072d6ea355db87cb8", "ja": "こうして、路上で歌うのは初めてですが……。\n私たちの歌を、聴いていただけたらと。", "zh": "我们是第一次像这样在街头唱歌……\n希望各位愿意给我们机会，听一听我们的演唱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1055_p", "source_sha256": "d9a7348f75af7de7bdf8a40b9fc1c70c16cae133b8376ef32f8ca5052924e226", "ja": "（千早のリードで、路上ライブがスタートした。\nはじめ、観客はまばらだったが……）", "zh": "（千早带头拉开街头演唱会的序幕。\n一开始，观众还寥寥可数……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1056_p", "source_sha256": "818b6707b3cf9c2a45c1495e9158e9b107b035b6e65b2a2f19aa2fcff866270a", "ja": "（徐々に足を止める人が増えていき、最終的には\n大勢の人が、5人の歌を聴いてくれた……）", "zh": "（然而渐渐地，停下脚步的人开始增加，\n最后聚集了大量人潮前来聆听这五人演唱……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1057_050jul", "source_sha256": "78465de302adaaa0b8d99a12d20ecfb5bd86bfcde5e38340e5972984f3e56386", "ja": "はー、歌った歌った……。\nまさかアンコールが3回もあるなんてな！", "zh": "啊～唱得好痛快……\n没想到会获得三次安可啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1058_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d0ef3c51b0d96cba973d4d04798f7cebaf87a706bdbe0eb2f2504b258118fd8a", "ja": "お客さんとこんなに近いライブは初めてだったけど、\nすごく楽しかったわ。ふふ、クセになっちゃいそう♪", "zh": "我第一次参加和观众距离这么近的演唱会，\n好好玩喔。呵呵，会让人上瘾呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1059_032emi", "source_sha256": "c2a131b6a2bf005fa5be13f9f3a6eea9778647481d28f96ce02ab981b022e6e2", "ja": "私もです……。見ていてくださる方々との\n呼びかけと応答に、胸が震えました……！", "zh": "我也这么觉得……和驻足的观众彼此呼唤及回应，\n让我好感动……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1060_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1c4e428b93e126043b1631b3b76af87fdbfa7b1458b157613f88ad744f7aa41b", "ja": "呼びかけと応答……あ、コールアンドレスポンスの\nことかな？　ふふっ、そうだね、楽しかったね！", "zh": "呼唤及回应……啊，是指「Call & response」吗？\n呵呵，就是说啊，很好玩呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1061_021mat", "source_sha256": "551895d7e798c0f69117411535165607898d0ab1243dbec5f8b1cda5ecb98f3b", "ja": "とっても、わんだほー！なライブだったのです。\nみんな、キラキラに輝いていたのですよ♪", "zh": "真是一场非常美妙的演唱会的喔！\n大家都很闪闪发光的唷♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1062_002chi", "source_sha256": "c9df83e3ce20ba792fa9a677fad7b3331e5a301331f1b2666e724bd200f8152a", "ja": "ええ、とても有意義な時間だった。\nまたいつか、みんなで路上ライブをしましょう。", "zh": "嗯，这是一段很有意义的时光。\n我们有机会再一起办街头演唱会吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1063_050jul", "source_sha256": "d58991fc362d481116ecadf04331e0dc1309730af79247b60a0b976492bfe15a", "ja": "ははっ、いいなそれ♪　……けどその前に、\nエターナルハーモニーの劇場公演だな！", "zh": "哈哈，真是个好主意♪……不过在那之前，\n还有『Eternal Harmony』的剧场公演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1064_050jul", "source_sha256": "0bdacf89a36ab3b1945bf254706dce00427a44cd89ce4bc2adc03c272b196f18", "ja": "本番も、やってやろうぜみんな！", "zh": "正式登台时，我们也要尽全力表演喔，各位！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1065_002chi", "source_sha256": "16c3c927cbbe437fb537aff19d9a1b5c6becc632aaf6358e4f60cddbcfe7091a", "ja": "ええ！（おー♪）", "zh": "好的！（好──♪）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1066_032emi", "source_sha256": "0522f5feb089c6d0ce8700a3a14d006211d88ef37bf2eed6509b13d9b6b2b377", "ja": "おー！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1067_041fuk", "source_sha256": "0522f5feb089c6d0ce8700a3a14d006211d88ef37bf2eed6509b13d9b6b2b377", "ja": "おー！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_06_1068_021mat", "source_sha256": "ebcfe7b4a840ae5f7a1a7aa77442725c00339ef4ca9e48ad4c236e9030cca46d", "ja": "おー♪", "zh": "好──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
